specs/hal-engine-single-terminal-frame/spec.md:17:- A malformed `ping` produces `error` (`INVALID_MESSAGE`) and no `stream_end` ([validated by: answers a malformed ping with INVALID_MESSAGE and no stream_end](../../src/transport/ws/messageHandler.test.ts#L366)).
