specs/hal-engine-single-terminal-frame/spec.md:25:- The rule in [websocket-protocol § 5.8](../hal-engine-websocket-protocol/spec.md) that the server MUST NOT send `stream_end` after an error is deleted, not supplemented, and a failed run now ends `error` then `stream_end` ([validated by: tells the client to retry when the provider is rate limited](../../src/transport/ws/messageHandler.test.ts#L311)).
